      <xsd:annotation>
       <xsd:documentation>Required. Describes whether this object was added by the Customer or as part of a Standard Taxonomy or by the System. Valid values are: Segment_Membership Custom Standard System Derived Bridge Curated Valid values available in API version 62.0 and later are: ADG Calculated_Insight CG_Audience Chunk Directory_Table External Semantic Transform Vector_Embedding</xsd:documentation>
